<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"source pendencies list\" style=\"margin-top:2px\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"TC pendency row\" style=\"height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"TC pendency code\" style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#173F35;width:58px\">P_TC_01</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"TC pendency name\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D;flex:1;min-width:0\">TC</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"TC pendency open status\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:#C17A4A\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"open status dot\" style=\"background:#C17A4A\"></span>Aberta</span>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2\" data-name=\"PC pendency row\" style=\"height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"PC pendency code\" style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#173F35;width:58px\">P_PC_01</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"PC pendency name\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D;flex:1;min-width:0\">PC</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"PC pendency resolved status\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"resolved status dot\" style=\"background:#A8B9A0\"></span>Resolvida na fato</span>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3\" data-name=\"ArCana pendency row\" style=\"height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"ArCana pendency code\" style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#173F35;width:58px\">P_AR_01</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"ArCana pendency name\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D;flex:1;min-width:0\">ArCana</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"ArCana pendency resolved status\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"resolved status dot\" style=\"background:#A8B9A0\"></span>Resolvida na fato</span>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-4\" data-name=\"Umidade pendency row\" style=\"height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"Umidade pendency code\" style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#173F35;width:58px\">P_UMB_01</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"Umidade pendency name\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D;flex:1;min-width:0\">Umidade</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-4-3\" data-name=\"Umidade pendency documented status\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"documented status dot\" style=\"background:#4E7966\"></span>Documentada</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-4\" data-name=\"horizontal divider line\" style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(37,49,45,.08);margin:8px 0\"></div>\n<div class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-5\" data-name=\"section heading for missing fields\" style=\"font-weight:600;color:#25312D\">Campos sem medição na base</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6\" data-name=\"missing fields list\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-1\" data-name=\"tons received missing field row\" style=\"height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"field name text\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D\">Toneladas recebidas</span><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"missing field status text\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C17A4A\">sem campo</span></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-2\" data-name=\"ATR tons missing field row\" style=\"height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"field name text\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D\">Toneladas de ATR</span><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"missing field status text\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C17A4A\">sem campo</span></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-3\" data-name=\"plan and goal missing field row\" style=\"height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-3-1\" data-name=\"field name text\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D\">Plano e meta</span><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-3-2\" data-name=\"missing field status text\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C17A4A\">sem campo</span></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-4\" data-name=\"equipment status missing field row\" style=\"height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-4-1\" data-name=\"field name text\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#25312D\">Status de equipamento</span><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-6-4-2\" data-name=\"missing field status text\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C17A4A\">sem campo</span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7\" data-name=\"footer note about weighted ATR\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">\n<span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-1\" data-name=\"warning status dot\" style=\"background:#C17A4A\"></span>ATR ponderado por TC indisponível\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- rodapé -->\n<div data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"page footer bar\" style=\"height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(37,49,45,.10)\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"footer source file text\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">Base_Usina_PowerBI_Final_v4.xlsx · Fato_Medicoes, Dim_Indicador, Dim_Calendario</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-2\" data-name=\"footer pending status group\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"pending records count item\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"warning status dot\" style=\"background:#C17A4A\"></span>903 registros pendentes</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"pending indicators count item\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"warning status dot\" style=\"background:#C17A4A\"></span>1 indicador pendente</span>\n<span class=\"link\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3\" data-name=\"view quality link\">Ver qualidade</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
