" data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"field label 'Equipamento'\">Equipamento</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"field value 'sem campo na fonte'\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#C17A4A\">sem campo na fonte</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"section divider\" data-reason=\"width is computed via flexbox measurement to fill the card\" style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(37,49,45,.08);margin:6px 0\"></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-4\" data-name=\"'Faixa observada' label row\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\">\n<span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1\" data-name=\"field label 'Faixa observada'\">Faixa observada</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2\" data-name=\"field value 'sem faixa aceitável'\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">sem faixa aceitável</span>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-5\" data-name=\"TC observed range visualization\" style=\"margin-top:2px\">\n<svg aria-label=\"Faixa observada de TC: mínimo 148,07, mediana 571,00 e máximo 779,82\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-5-1\" data-name=\"min-median-max range bar SVG\" fill=\"none\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 320 44\" width=\"320\"><line stroke=\"#EFEDE5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"8\" x1=\"30.0\" x2=\"293.3\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line stroke=\"#A8B9A0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"30.0\" x2=\"293.3\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" r=\"4.5\" stroke=\"#4E7966\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle><circle cx=\"293.3\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" r=\"4.5\" stroke=\"#4E7966\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle><line stroke=\"#173F35\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"206.2\" x2=\"206.2\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"21\"></line><text fill=\"#76817B\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"30.0\" y=\"37\">148,07</text><text fill=\"#25312D\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"206.2\" y=\"37\">571,00</text><text fill=\"#76817B\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"293.3\" y=\"37\">779,82</text></svg>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-6\" data-name=\"section divider\" style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(37,49,45,.08);margin:6px 0\"></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7\" data-name=\"source and last measurement info row\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-1\" data-name=\"selected source info group\">\n<div class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"field label 'Fonte da seleção'\">Fonte da seleção</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-1-2\" data-name=\"source name 'Frente 12'\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600\">Frente 12</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-1-3\" data-name=\"source stats text\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#76817B\">1.496 registros, 152 dias com dado</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-2\" data-name=\"last measurement group\" style=\"text-align:right\">\n<div class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-2-1\" data-name=\"field label 'Última medição'\">Última medição</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-7-2-2\" data-name=\"last measurement date\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px\">11/12/2026</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-2-8\" data-name=\"context card action buttons\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:flex;gap:8px\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-8-1\" data-name=\"primary 'Abrir registro' button\" style=\"flex:1;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#173F35;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">Abrir registro <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow-right icon\" style=\"font-size:14px\"></i></span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-2-8-2\" data-name=\"secondary 'Rastreabilidade' button\" style=\"height:34px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(37,49,45,.14);font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center\">Rastreabilidade</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- rodapé -->\n<div data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"footer info bar\" style=\"height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(37,49,45,.10)\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"footer data source attribution\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">Base_Usina_PowerBI_Final_v4.xlsx · Fato_Medicoes, Dim_Indicador, Dim_Calendario</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-2\" data-name=\"footer summary statistics\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:#76817B\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"footer stat 'registros pendentes'\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot\" style=\"background:#C17A4A\"></span>903 registros pendentes</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"footer stat 'ajustes de escala'\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"status dot\" style=\"background:#A8B9A0\"></span>1.585 ajustes de escala</span>\n<span class=\"link\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3\" data-name=\"footer 'Ver rastreabilidade' link\">Ver rastreabilidade</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
